00:57:51.410 --> 00:58:02.260
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[资助鸣谢]

00:58:02.260 --> 00:58:09.200
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia. His ways are mysterious. None can know them. He keeps commanding us--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责。他的方式是神秘的。没人能知道它们。他一直命令我们——

00:58:09.200 --> 00:58:13.710
<v Bill Lychak>Go to Peoria. Give away all you possess and go to Peoria.
<v Bill Lychak>去皮奥里亚。放弃你拥有的一切，去皮奥里亚。

00:58:13.710 --> 00:58:56.520
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:56.520 --> 00:59:01.520
